                                                "sense_id": "2f508882-8629-3677-9740-18d2758c903f",
                                                "text": "“It is a welcome first step. [We] hope it will get Rawalpindi (Pakistan’s military) thinking,” a senior official told The Hindu, although the government issued no formal reaction to the development."
